    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "where η(t) is white Gaussian noise, and we have replaced n by x. The finite-time blowup statistics for this model and its extensions has been recently studied in Ref. [2], see also Refs. [3–5]."
